:: Start
The night is clear and full of stars. Somewhere above you, a hawk circles.

[[Look up|Sky]]
[[Keep walking|Path]]

:: Sky
Its wings catch the starlight, tiny white sparks scattered across deep blue.

[[Wave|Wave]]

:: Path
You keep walking. The hawk follows, curious.

[[Look up|Sky]]

:: Wave
The hawk dips a wing, as if to say hello.

<<link "Start over" "Start">><</link>>
